## Rollback / restore

* Back to stock Android 6.0.1: needs a backup of your own tablet (`parameter`, `resource`, `kernel`, `boot`, `system` partitions);
  none is shipped here. Restore by writing them back with `rkdeveloptool wl` at the LBAs listed above (`system` is 3145728 sectors at
  `0x92000`, `boot` 65536 sectors at `0x16000`), zero the head of `userdata` (`0x3BA000`) so stock Android reformats it, then `rkdeveloptool rd`.
* Re-flash this release: run `flash.sh` again (no state is kept on the host).

